      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NAME OF LOVE (1) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last start finished 2nd over 350m at this track beaten a nose (19.10) behind Tuta Sun in a Grade 3/4 on November 13. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. WOLF CREEK (4) broke the clock when winning over 300m at this track last start, taking a Grade 3/4 in a dazzling 16.07. Has the ability and can measure up again. ALTONA BEACH (3) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 19.25 beating Last Love. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. HOLD THE GAVEL (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
